g at the original, line 50 is part of the \'Install Docker packages\' task, which has a long \'when\' condition. So to fix the line length, I can break the line into multiple lines with proper YAML formatting.\n\nSimilarly, line 93 is part of the \'Include docker-compose.yml tasks\' task, which has a long \'when\' condition.\n\nSo, to fix the line length issues, I can split the \'when\' conditions into multiple lines, ensuring each line is under 80 characters.\n\nPutting it all together, the corrections needed are:\n\n1. Add a space after the colon in \'when\' conditions to fix the truthy value errors.\n2. Split long \'when\' conditions into multiple lines to adhere to the 80-character limit.\n\nNow, let me apply these changes to the original playbook.\n\nFor line 5, change `when:ansible_version < "2.12" or ansible_os_family in ["RedHat", "Debian"]` to have a space after the colon:\n\nwhen: ansible_version < "2.12" or ansible_os_family in ["RedHat", "Debian"]\n\nSimilarly, for line 19, add a space after the colon:\n\nwhen: docker_install_compose_plugin and ansible_version < "2.12" or ansible_os_family not in ["RedHat", "Debian"]\n\nFor line 25, add a space after the colon and split the condition into multiple lines to fix the syntax error:\n\nwhen: docker_install_compose_plugin and ansible_version >= "2.12" and ansible_os_family in ["RedHat", "Debian"]\n\nWait, no, line 25 was causing a syntax error because it was missing the space after the colon. So adding the space would fix it.\n\nFor the line length issues on lines 50 and 93, I\'ll need to split the \'when\' conditions into multiple lines.\n\nLooking at line 50, the \'when\' condition is:\n\nwhen:ansible_version < "2.12" or ansible_os_family in ["RedHat", "Debian"]\n\nI can split this into:\n\nwhen:\n  - ansible_version < "2.12"\n  - ansible_os_family in ["RedHat", "Debian"]\n\nBut wait, the \'when\' can take a list of conditions, so using a list would be better and also help with line length.\n\nSimilarly, for