l it if not. Then, notify reboot.\n\nTask 7 uses zypper to update software and notify reboot. I\'ll use zypper with state=update and notify.\n\nI need to make sure each task is in the correct order as specified. Also, each task should have the exact names and modules as described. I\'ll avoid adding any extra tasks or modifying existing ones.\n\nI\'ll structure each task with a name and the appropriate module and parameters. For tasks that require notifications, I\'ll add the notify field pointing to the reboot handler.\n\nLet me double-check each task to ensure I\'m using the correct modules and parameters. For example, in Task 6, I need to use become to run commands as root, and inside that, check and install yum-utils.\n\nI\'ll also ensure that the YAML syntax is correct, with proper indentation and no trailing spaces. Each task starts with a dash and is properly indented under the tasks key.\n\nFinally, I\'ll compile all these tasks into the playbook, starting with \'---\', followed by the tasks in order. I\'ll make sure there are no comments or explanations, just the YAML code as required.\n</think>\n\n```yaml\n---\n- name: Import assert.yml\n  import_tasks: assert.yml\n\n- name: Configure apk\n  become: yes\n  apk:\n    state: update\n    command: upgrade\n  notify: reboot\n\n- name: Configure apt\n  become: yes\n  apt:\n    upgrade: yes\n    autoremove: yes\n    state: present\n    exclude_packages: [\'nginx\']\n  notify: reboot\n\n- name: Update all software (dnf)\n  become: yes\n  dnf:\n    state: update\n    exclude: [\'dnf\', \'python3\']\n  notify: reboot\n\n- name: Update all software (pacman)\n  become: yes\n  pacman:\n    state: update\n  notify: reboot\n\n- name: Configure yum\n  become: yes\n  yum:\n    name: "*"\n    state: present\n    upgrade: yes\n  become: yes\n  shell: yum install yum-utils\n  ignore_errors: yes\n  notify: reboot\n\n- name: Update all software (zypper)\n  become: yes\n  zypper:\n    state: update\n  notify: reboot\n```' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'deepseek-r1:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-18T09:08:47.513482503Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 18118941224, 'load_duration': 100887500, 'prompt_eval_count': 464, 'prompt_eval_duration': 146587663, 'eval_count': 904, 'eval_duration': 17869842909, 'model_name': 'deepseek-r1:14b'} id='run--5266361e-bdb7-4386-85df-009ad5c947a4-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 464, 'output_tokens': 904, 'total_tokens': 1368}
