ersion.rc != 0)\n\n- name: Ensure helm is executable\n  shell: chmod +x /usr/local/bin/helm\n  when: (helm_exists.rc != 0) or (helm_version.rc != 0)\n```" additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'deepseek-r1:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-18T09:16:31.214868382Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 8995982722, 'load_duration': 92840131, 'prompt_eval_count': 355, 'prompt_eval_duration': 82101587, 'eval_count': 539, 'eval_duration': 8820417700, 'model_name': 'deepseek-r1:14b'} id='run--e1f02fba-1209-4d6b-8cf6-7233e8d81f53-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 355, 'output_tokens': 539, 'total_tokens': 894}
